/* AVX2 message schedule for a SINGLE stream: compute 16 schedule words at a time
   isn't directly possible (dependency distance 2 and 15), but we can still use
   SSSE3-style byte shuffles for the initial load and do the rest scalar with
   careful unrolling. This file measures a well-scheduled scalar compress
